# NOTE: lib/ is NOT ignored — the built host/client bundles are committed so a
# GitHub install (dsh plugin add github:z-col/dsh-SkillsManagePlugins) needs no
# build script at all (pnpm >= 10 blocks git-dependency build scripts by default).
# Rebuild before committing src changes: pnpm build

